window.products.push({"id":105134,"name":"Dishwasher Diverter Valve Diverter Motor Seal Grommet Gasket Replacement Part for WPW10195677 W10195677","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oQSb2QXkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nobody Likes Doing Dishes When the Dishwasher is Broken and Leaking!!! If your dishwasher is leaking underneath, chances are that your Diverter Valve Seal is leaking.  Don't worry, it's a QUICK and EASY repair - This seal is what you need and it SHIPS FAST and FREE so you don't have to do those dishes by hand any more!!  Buy this genuine part from The Grommet Guru and take care of that leak right away!!! This BRAND NEW Industrial Grade Dishwasher Diverter Valve Seal Grommet is a direct replacement for Whirlpool part number WPW10195677 or W10195677.  This new seal grommet will fit common brands made by the following manufacturers: Whirlpool Whirlpool KitchenAid KitchenAid Maytag Maytag Amana Amana Hotpoint Hotpoint Jenn-Air Jenn-Air Estate Estate Roper Roper Admiral Admiral Inglis Inglis Magic Chef Magic Chef This seal grommet installs under the Diffuser and around the Diverter Motor Shaft and will fix that leak!  The repair is quick and fairly easy for anyone who is somewhat handy.  This gasket will prevent you from having to buy the expensive Diverter Motor or the entire Sump Assembly and will save you hundreds of dollars in dishwasher repair service costs. General repair instructions will be included!! This Diverter Valve Seal Grommet Seal is made of Industrial Grade Nitrile Butadiene Rubber and can withstand 248F.  Its inner wall is reinforced with a garter spring which ensures seal integrity under load. Specs: Inner Diameter: 5.5mm Inner Diameter: 5.5mm Outer Diameter: 16mm Outer Diameter: 16mm Width Diameter: 8mm Width Diameter: 8mm Seal Material : Nitrile Butadiene Rubber Seal Material : Nitrile Butadiene Rubber Temperature Range : -40F to 248F Temperature Range : -40F to 248F Note: Keep in mind this gasket will only repair a leaky diverter motor shaft seal. MESSAGE US TO VERIFY FITMENT!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oQSb2QXkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GrommetGuru","source_asin":"B087HCSV7S","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-105134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087HCSV7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087HCSV7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
