window.products.push({"id":105496,"name":"DC47-00019A Dryer Heating Element - Dryer Repair Kit by Beaquicy Replacement for Samsung - DC96-00887A & DC47-00016A Thermal Fuse & DC32-00007A Dryer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713ngf0Ni1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【IDEAL REPLACEMENT】--- The package includes 1 x DC47-00019A, 1 x DC96-00887A , 1 x DC47-00016A, 1 x DC47-00018A, 1 x DC32-00007A. ①Heating element DC47-00019A generates the dryer's heat. ②Thermal cut-off fuse DC96-00887A is a Limit Switch Working at 320 deg. F. ③Resistance of DC47-00016A Dryer thermal fuse increases with temperature. ④ DC47-00018A Dryer Thermostat ensures that the dryer does not get too hot.⑤DC32-00007A Dryer Thermistor is used for overheat protection of electrical equipment. ✅【HIGHLIGHTS&FUNCTIONS】---The DC47-00019A sam-sung dryer heater element kit is made of quality material. The nickel-chromium content of DC47-00019A heater element reaches 80%, and the length of the electric heating wire is longer than that of other ordinary dryer replacement parts, replacement resistance increased by 25%. The part can fix the following symptoms: ①Takes too long to dry; ②No heat or no enough heat; ③Shuts off too soon; ④Will not start. If in these case, please replace it in time. ✅【WIDE COMPATIBILITY】---DC47-00019A Dryer Heating Element Kit can fit for Sam-sung, Ken-more Dryer.◆Replaces numbers:★DC47-00019A: AP4201899, 2068550, PS2038533, EAP2038533, 40289032010, 40289032012, etc.★DC96-00887A: 2074129, AP4207819, PS4216838, EAP4216838, etc.★DC47-00016A: 2068545, AP4201894, AP4205213, PS4205213, 40289032012, 40289032010, etc.★DC47-00018A: 1122485, AP4201898, PS2430930, EAP2430930, DV410AERXAA, etc.★DC32-00007A:2068429, AP4201716, PS2461163, EAP2461163, DV220AEWXAA, etc. ✅【AFTER-SALES GUARANTEE】---The product DC47-00019A Dryer Heating Element Assembly Kit supports 90 days return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【CONVENIENT FOR YOUR LIFE】---Before replacing DC47-00019A Dryer Heating Element Kit, disconnect your dryer from its power source before starting the repair and wear work gloves to protect your hands. Check the parts that need to be replaced with the heater assembly. There are complete installation videos on YouTube to help you install easily. Perform a continuity check from the terminal to the housing before putting your dryer back together,or else you may have to pull it all apart a 2nd time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713ngf0Ni1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B085NPZD9M","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-105496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085NPZD9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B085NPZD9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
