window.products.push({"id":105576,"name":"DC47-00019a Dryer Heating Element Kit include:Thermal Fuse DC96-00887A and DC47-00016A /Thermistor DC32-00007A/ Thermostat DC47-00018A for Sam-sung Ke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JEJgkSs1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Dryer Heating Element Assembly】(DC47-00019A)Dryer Heating Element contains insulators&restrings coil with POWER-5300W VOLTAGE-240 and 2* 5/16\" male terminal connections (DC96-00887A 320 degrees F high limit thermal fuse&DC47-00016A Dryer thermal fuse ) (DC47-00018A)Dryer Thermostat 260 degrees F with 1/4'' male terminals (DC32-00007A)Dryer thermistor temperature sensor. 【Dryer Replace Part Numbers】This dryer heater elements fits specific Samsung Dryer models and some Whirlpool, Sears Kenmore models:①DC47-00019A:#35001247 35001119 AP4045884 1185561 AH2038533 EA2038533 ERDC47-00019A PS2038533# ②DC47-00016A: #AP4201894 PS2038378# ③DC47-00018A:#PS2038383 AP4201898 AP4201899 35001092 ②DC96-00887A:#PS2038484 AP4207819 ④DC32-00007A:#2068429 AP4201716 PS2461163 EAP2461163. 【Genuine Quality Design】DC47-00019A heating element is made of nickel chrome wire and go as high as 98%.The electric wire coil is tightly wound to ensure good heating performance and reliable quality to ensure its durability. 【Install&DIY New Dryer】Unplug the appliance before installation:1-To replace the heating element in your dryer, first remove the screws and slide the panel to lift it off 2-Use a flathead screwdriver to remove the screw securing the heating element housing and detach 3-Position the new heating element and insert the terminals 4-Rejoin the two halves of the heating element housing by inserting the tabs through the slots then bend down the inner tab 5-Reposition thermostat and thermal limit. 【Global Quality Service】Cobectal dedicates to provide the First-Rate products supported by the professional engineering team and good A service by customer-guarantee. We hope you enjoy Online Shopping and welcome any comments or suggestions you have.If you’re unsatisfied with the item, we are glad to offer you full refund or new replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JEJgkSs1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cobectal","source_asin":"B09X9V2MR8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-105576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X9V2MR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X9V2MR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
