window.products.push({"id":105725,"name":"Sanabul Handwrap Zippered Washing Bag (Available in 2 Sizes)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hE+Gs6LTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Helps keep your wraps last longer. By washing your boxing, kickboxing or MMA handwraps in our washing bag you can help increase the lifespan of your products. Machine washing generally causes tangles, wrinkling, and general wear and tear of the velcro closure of your handwraps. Sanabul Handwrap Washing Bags help you prevent those issues. Tangled, wrinkled, handwraps are a thing of the past. Ever washed your handwraps with the rest of your clothes and found everything comes out in a ball? Save yourself the headache of untangling your hand wraps by washing them in the Sanabul Handwrap Washing Bags Available in two sizes. Our 'Standard' size comfortably fits 2-3 pairs of handwraps (depending on length and thickness of your wraps) and the \"Large\" size fits approximately 5-6 pairs of hand wraps (depending on length and thickness of your wraps) Ideal Washing Instructions. We always recommend washing your hand wraps in cold water, separately or with similar colors (no white clothes *same general instructions as colored t-shirts, etc ) and hang drying or tumble drying in the machine (zero-low heat) Standard Size: 10 inches x 10 inches. Large Size: 13 inches x 15 inches. Please note the hand wrap washing bags DO NOT COME WITH HANDWRAPS","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hE+Gs6LTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sanabul","source_asin":"B07NHBTJ3F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-105725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NHBTJ3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NHBTJ3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
