window.products.push({"id":105825,"name":"Puroflo DA97-17376B Replacement for Samsung HAF-QIN/EXP, HAF-QIN, DA97-08006C, RF28R7351SG, RF23M8070SR, RF23M8070SG, RF23M8090SG, RF28R7201SR, RF23M8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810D8z5yoYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【💦 NSF/ANSI 42 AND 372 DOUBLE CERTIFIED】Puroflo YFG-DA97-1736B water filters for refrigerators is made of 100% pure and natural coconut carbon block. It is tested and certified by NSF & IAPMO & WQA international standard to be lead-free, BPA-free and food-grade safe filter materials. These certifications are widely recognized around the world in water safety. Puroflo fridge filters also certified by European TUV, ROHS, REACH, Canadian CSA, and Australian Water Mark. 【💦 EFFICIENT & POWERFUL FILTRATION 】The Puroflo filter replacement for everydrop filter 4 is made of a 0.5㎛ inner layer which is verified to efficiently remove most of chlorine and other harmful impurities such as pesticides, herbicides, spore, heavy metals, sediments, bad taste & odors, and other particles from your water while keeping minerals in the water that your body needs. It is recommended to change the filter every 6 months or every 300 gallons. (Depending on local water quality) 【💦 100% SAME FIT AS ORIGINAL 】This Puroflo YFG-DA97-1736B water filter replacement has been manufactured to the exact design and fit as the original. We can guarantee there is no water leak risk due to unfit or loose-fitting replacement refrigerator filters. With the \"Twist and Lock\"design, no tools are required to install this refrigerator water filter. It is an easy DIY filter replacement that can be done in just few minutes. 【💦 BETTER TASTING WATER】Our 100% pure and natural coconut shell activated carbon block enhances the filter's adsorption capability. More impurities can be absorbed compred to other cheaply made carbon blocks. The material of the fillter used in the Puroflo refrigerator filter significantly improves the overall taste of your drinking water. Enjoy the pure and fresh tasting water for you and your family! 【💦 COMPATIBLE MODELS】Replacement forSamsung DA97-17376B, DA97-08006C, HAF-QIN, HAF-QIN/EXP, GLACIER FRESH GF-841, Crystala CF-17, Waterdrop WD-DA97-17376B, AQUACREST AQF-DA97-17376B, Water specialist WS645A, FilterLogic FL-RF45. scroll down to see more compatible details.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810D8z5yoYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puroflo","source_asin":"B09TVML31R","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-105825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TVML31R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TVML31R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
