window.products.push({"id":105865,"name":"DC97-16742A Samsung Dryer Lint Trap Screen Filter Replacement DV40J3000EW/A2 DV45H7000EW/A2 DVE50M7450W/A3 DV45H7000GW/A2 DV48H7400EW/A2 DV48J7700EW/A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FkKSM-K-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Dc97-16742a Samsung Dryer Lint Screen With Flap - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers 3319952, AP5306681, PS4221839. Filters are completely washable & reusable to help your budget. Dc97-16742a Dryer Lint Filter Screen Replacement is compatible with Samsung appliances. Dc97-16742a Dryer Lint Filter fits dozens of models and can be installed in a few minutes. Samsung Dc97-16742a Dryer Lint Screen is durable and should last for several years with proper care and maintenance. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace Samsung Dc97-16742a? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. DC97-16742A Dryer Lint Catcher may become damaged or worn out. When this happens, it is important to replace the filter with a new one to ensure the proper functioning of your Samsung dryer. Replacement filters are widely available and can be easily installed. 💡 The DC97-16742A Samsung Dryer Lint Trap Screen Filter is made of high-quality materials that are designed to withstand regular use and exposure to heat. Dryer Lint Screen Dc97-16742a is durable and should last for several years with proper care and maintenance. Dc97-16742a Samsung Dryer Lint Trap Screen Filter Replacement meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Where is lint filter in Samsung dryer? The location of the lint filter in a Samsung dryer can vary depending on the model, but it is usually located near the dryer door, either on the top of the dryer or inside the door opening.To access the filter, you will need to open the door of the appliance and look for a small rectangular cover or compartment. Clean the lint filter after every wash cycle to prevent lint buildup and ensure proper functioning of your Samsung dryer. 💡 Can I use my dryer without a lint filter? It is not recommended to use your dryer without a lint filter. The lint filter plays a critical role in catching lint, debris, and other particles that can accumulate in your dryer and potentially cause a fire. Without a lint filter, these particles can build up in the dryer's exhaust system and create a serious safety hazard. In addition, using a dryer without a lint filter can also cause damage to your dryer's internal components.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FkKSM-K-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B088MM57MP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-105865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088MM57MP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B088MM57MP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
